---
// Dual-track activation band: equal-weight designer + manufacturer columns.
// Copy: docs/growth/copy/hero.md ("Dual-track activation band").
---

<section class="relative">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20 md:px-10 md:py-28 lg:py-32">
    <h2
      class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight leading-tight max-w-2xl"
    >
      How to use ULC?
    </h2>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-10">
      <article
        class="border border-token rounded-lg p-8 md:p-10"
        style="background: var(--bg-elevated);"
      >
        <h3 class="small-caps text-xs text-[var(--text-subtle)]">Designers</h3>
        <p
          class="mt-3 text-base md:text-lg text-[var(--text)] leading-relaxed"
        >
          Designers consume ULC today through any tool that reads JSON, starting
          with the LLM above. As designers ask their preferred manufacturer reps
          for ULC files, manufacturers publish. The adoption registry below
          grows.
        </p>
        <a
          href="/for-designers"
          class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-[var(--accent-warm)] hover:underline underline-offset-4"
        >
          Read the designer track <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </article>

      <article
        class="border border-token rounded-lg p-8 md:p-10"
        style="background: var(--bg-elevated);"
      >
        <h3 class="small-caps text-xs text-[var(--text-subtle)]">
          Manufacturers
        </h3>
        <p
          class="mt-3 text-base md:text-lg text-[var(--text)] leading-relaxed"
        >
          Manufacturers publish ULC so their products surface in AI-mediated
          specifier discovery with accurate attributes. The data the designer's
          tool consumes comes from your infrastructure, fetched directly,
          verifiable to your source files by SHA-256 hash.
        </p>
        <a
          href="/for-manufacturers"
          class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-[var(--accent-warm)] hover:underline underline-offset-4"
        >
          Read the manufacturer track <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
